    "notes": "Stripe collects customer payments into the platform balance. AI providers, creation platforms, social networks, MCP hosts, third-party APIs, and generic connectors bill the platform separately (or the customer via BYOK/app credentials) unless Crystal documents a Stripe Connect relationship with that provider. BYOK / bring-your-own-app-credentials removes platform credit exposure for that connector. Stripe does NOT pay third parties directly by default."
